## Run
```bash
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
pip install ansible boto3 botocore
ansible-galaxy collection install -r collections/requirements.yml
aws configure                                   # credentials for {{ aws_region }}

zip worker.zip handler.py                        # package your worker first
ansible-playbook preflight.yml
ansible-playbook site.yml --check
ansible-playbook site.yml
```

> Package your worker as `lambda_zip` (default `worker.zip`) before running. The
> event-source mapping wires the queue to the Lambda automatically.
